('hotel-norbu-house-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Norbu House', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Norbu House sits on a ridge a little above the main bustle of McLeod Ganj, close to Hotel Bhagsu and facing the Dalai Lama Temple side of the hill. The rooms are done up with Tibetan-inspired woodwork, painted borders and woven rugs, and the categories run from Norbu Premium Plus and Royal Norbu Super Deluxe up to the Yewang Suite and Grand Norbu Suite. Guests who have stayed describe it as comfortable and homely rather than flashy, with warm staff, good views and a decent breakfast.

There is a garden, a terrace, a restaurant and cafe, a lift and free parking, which makes it one of the easier upper-end hotels to arrive at by car. A shortcut path leads down to Temple Road when you want to walk to the temple, cafes and market, so you get the quiet of the ridge without being cut off from town. It suits couples, families and older travellers who want a comfortable base and do not mind paying for it. Meals in the restaurant are priced a little above what you would pay in the cafes below, so eat out on some evenings.', 'A Tibetan-styled hotel set above the noise of Temple Road, with a garden, terrace restaurant and suites that look out over the valley.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Near Hotel Bhagsu, on the ridge facing the Dalai Lama Temple, McLeod Ganj', 'Near Hotel Bhagsu, on the ridge facing the Dalai Lama Temple, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Cafe","Room service","Garden","Terrace","Lift","Parking","Business centre","Conference room","Mountain views","Free parking"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0584l12000cseb13vBCE5_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Hotel Norbu House building with glazed corner and balconies on the McLeod Ganj ridge","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0584p12000kyiuotf2230_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Guest room with Tibetan knot headboard and woven rug at Hotel Norbu House","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0580o12000sxkaokzAE87_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Spacious room with sitting chair and Tibetan-border ceiling at Hotel Norbu House","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0582j12000kyiuyfgB6C8_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Restaurant dining hall with Tibetan murals at Hotel Norbu House","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585c12000t1r5hve0855_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Valley and Dhauladhar hillside view from Hotel Norbu House","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0583712000i5ib06q9380_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Upper balcony walkway outside rooms at Hotel Norbu House","category":"other","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik0c12000nobsfsnF7DE_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Conference hall with a Potala Palace mural at Hotel Norbu House","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Norbu Premium Plus","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Royal Norbu Super Deluxe","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Yewang Suite","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Grand Norbu Suite","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel Norbu House located?","answer":"Hotel Norbu House is in Near Hotel Bhagsu, on the ridge facing the Dalai Lama Temple, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Hotel Bhagsu -- next door on the ridge; Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- short walk down."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Hotel Norbu House?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 12:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Hotel Norbu House best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families, senior travellers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Hotel Norbu House?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '12:00', 'Pets are not allowed.', 'Rooms are non-smoking; no smoking in public areas.', NULL, 'upscale', '["Tibetan-style rooms and suites on a quiet ridge","Garden, terrace and in-house restaurant and cafe","Lift and free private parking","Short path down to Temple Road and the temple complex"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Families","Senior travellers"]'::jsonb, '["Hotel Bhagsu -- next door on the ridge","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- short walk down","McLeod Ganj main square and Tibetan market lanes -- 10 min walk","Kangra Airport -- about 17 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://ph.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-81986949/hotel-norbu-house', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://booking.com/hotel/in/norbu-house.en-gb.html , https://ph.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-81986949/hotel-norbu-house , https://www.mcleodganjhotels.net/norbu-house.en.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-bella-heights-temple-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Bella Heights', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Bella Heights is a newer hotel on Temple Road, opened in 2024, and it is one of the closest full-service hotels to the Dalai Lama Temple complex. Its 22 rooms are all king-bedded and come as Standard, Superior and Suite rooms with balconies, plus a Deluxe room. Guests mention clean rooms, helpful staff and balconies that look onto the valley or the mountains.

The facilities are modern for McLeod Ganj: a restaurant on the roof, a gym, a conference room, co-working space, free parking and valet parking. Some booking sites list it under the name Zip by Spree Hotels Bella Heights. It is a good fit for couples, small groups and business or remote-work travellers who want to be on the temple side of town without staying in a guesthouse. Rooms are non-smoking and pets are not allowed.', 'A recently built hotel on Temple Road with balcony rooms, a rooftop restaurant and the Dalai Lama Temple a few minutes away.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Temple Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Temple Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Gym","Free parking","Valet parking","Conference room","Co-working space","Laundry service","24-hour front desk","Balcony","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0221212000l18brci2F65_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Hotel Bella Heights building with Zip signage","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0220w12000p9tpd9qE34D_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"King-bed room with wood floor and sofa at Hotel Bella Heights","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik4c12000o436pzcEDD9_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Reception and lobby seating at Hotel Bella Heights","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222z12000j5g8vr49FBE_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Rooftop restaurant with mountain views at Hotel Bella Heights","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0200l120008h7ctarE319_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Lit rooftop walkway with Buddha statue at Hotel Bella Heights","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0221y12000p9tpfza32D9_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Guest corridor with Buddha painting at Hotel Bella Heights","category":"other","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik2s12000nob3byq5ABF_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Conference hall at Hotel Bella Heights","category":"amenity","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Suite Room with Balcony","description":"","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Superior Room with Balcony","description":"","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Standard Room with Balcony","description":"","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel Bella Heights located?","answer":"Hotel Bella Heights is in Temple Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- 3 min walk; Start of the McLeod Ganj kora circuit -- about 200 m."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Hotel Bella Heights?","answer":"Check-in is from 14:00 and check-out is by 12:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Hotel Bella Heights best for?","answer":"It suits couples, small groups, remote workers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Hotel Bella Heights?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '14:00', '12:00', 'Pets are not allowed.', 'Rooms are non-smoking; no smoking in public areas.', NULL, 'mid-range', '["Opened 2024 with 22 king-bed rooms","Balcony rooms and suites with valley or mountain views","Restaurant, gym and co-working space","Free parking on Temple Road"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Small groups","Remote workers"]'::jsonb, '["Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- 3 min walk","Start of the McLeod Ganj kora circuit -- about 200 m","Tsechokling Gompa -- about 450 m","Dharamshala Skyway station -- about 5 min drive"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://in.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-61933910/zip-by-spree-hotels-bella-heights-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://in.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-61933910/zip-by-spree-hotels-bella-heights-mcleodganj/ , https://ca.hotels.com/ho1114202336/zip-by-spree-hotels-bella-heights-mcleodganj-dharamshala-india , https://ostrovok.ru/hotel/india/naddi/mid6317868/bella_heights_/ , https://www.mcleodganjhotels.net/bella-heights-inn.en.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-m-and-resort-temple-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel M and Resort McLeod Ganj', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel M and Resort occupies the Mount View Complex on Dalai Lama Temple Road, in the middle of the stretch most visitors walk every day. The hotel has three room categories: Deluxe, Executive with a balcony, and Suite, and the rooms were recently refurbished with a cleaner, more modern look. The balconies face the valley.

The best-known feature is the open-terrace restaurant and bar, which has valley views and, according to guest reviews, live music on some evenings. A travel desk handles transfers, guides and adventure activities such as treks to Triund and Indrahar, and the hotel is approved by Himachal Pradesh Tourism. It suits couples and groups who want a lively, central address with food and drink on site. Some booking sites list it as Tripli Hotels M and Resort.', 'A government-approved deluxe hotel on Dalai Lama Temple Road with refurbished balcony rooms and an open-terrace restaurant and bar.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Mount View Complex, Dalai Lama Temple Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Mount View Complex, Dalai Lama Temple Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Bar","Open terrace","Room service","Travel desk","Airport transfer","Balcony","Valley views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Executive Room with Balcony","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Suite Room","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel M and Resort McLeod Ganj located?","answer":"Hotel M and Resort McLeod Ganj is in Mount View Complex, Dalai Lama Temple Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- close by on Temple Road; McLeod Ganj main square -- close by."},{"question":"Who is Hotel M and Resort McLeod Ganj best for?","answer":"It suits couples, groups of friends, first-time visitors. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Hotel M and Resort McLeod Ganj?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["On Dalai Lama Temple Road in the centre of town","Recently refurbished Deluxe, Executive and Suite rooms","Open-terrace restaurant and bar with valley views","Travel desk for transfers, guides and treks"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Groups of friends","First-time visitors"]'::jsonb, '["Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- close by on Temple Road","McLeod Ganj main square -- close by","Dal Lake -- short drive","Norbulingka Institute -- short drive"]'::jsonb, 'https://mhotel.in/', NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://mhotel.in/ , https://www.mcleodganjhotels.net/resort-tripli-hotels-m.en.html. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('serkong-house-nowrojee-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Serkong House', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'Serkong House is on Nowrojee Road, the quieter lane that runs up towards Tushita Meditation Centre. Lonely Planet describes an unsigned three-storey building reached by steps down from the top end of the road, and one traveller review notes that it is built and decorated in a traditional Tibetan style, clean and tidy, with views across the valley. Rooms are listed as superior, suite and twin categories.

Both the Dalai Lama Temple complex and Tushita are within roughly ten minutes on foot, which makes it handy for retreat-goers and for anyone who prefers a calmer street to the main square. Booking sites list a 24-hour front desk, laundry and daily housekeeping, free WiFi and no on-site parking. Note that there is no lift and the approach involves steps, so pack light. There is also a separate property called New Serkong House, so check the name when you book.', 'A Tibetan-style guesthouse down a flight of steps from the top of Nowrojee Road, close to Tushita and the temple.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Nowrojee Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Nowrojee Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Laundry service","24-hour front desk","Daily housekeeping","Valley views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Superior Room","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Suite","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Twin Room","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Serkong House located?","answer":"Serkong House is in Nowrojee Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Tushita Meditation Centre -- about 8 min walk; Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Serkong House?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Serkong House best for?","answer":"It suits retreat and meditation visitors, solo travellers, couples. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Serkong House?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', 'Pets are not allowed.', NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Tibetan-style building on quiet Nowrojee Road","Walk to Tushita Meditation Centre and the Dalai Lama Temple","Superior, suite and twin rooms","24-hour front desk and laundry"]'::jsonb, '["Retreat and meditation visitors","Solo travellers","Couples"]'::jsonb, '["Tushita Meditation Centre -- about 8 min walk","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk","Kangra Airport -- about 45 min drive"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://ie.hotels.com/ho2814515360/serkong-house-dharamshala-india , https://www.expedia.com.au/Dharamshala-Hotels-Serkong-House.h87922355.Hotel-Information , https://ostrovok.ru/hotel/india/jadrangal/mid10315465/serkong_house/ , https://www.lonelyplanet.com/india/dharamsala/hotels?page=1. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('zambala-house-himachal-tourism-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Zambala House', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'Zambala House is at the end of Himachal Tourism Road, on the calmer edge of McLeod Ganj and close to the monastery. It is a small guesthouse and review sites rank it among the better-rated places in town, with guests praising spacious, clean, dry rooms (a real plus in monsoon), helpful staff, a good breakfast and mountain views. There is a restaurant on site and a laundry service.

It is a good pick for travellers who want something more comfortable than a basic guesthouse but still homely, and who do not mind a short uphill walk to the market. Some guests find the rates a little high in the off-season, so ask about discounts for longer stays. Car access can be limited at the top of the lane, so check with the guesthouse about where to park before you arrive.', 'A well-reviewed small guesthouse at the quiet end of Himachal Tourism Road, with clean rooms, mountain views and a good breakfast.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'End of Himachal Tourism Road, McLeod Ganj', 'End of Himachal Tourism Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Laundry service","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Zambala House located?","answer":"Zambala House is in End of Himachal Tourism Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Namgyal Monastery and the markets -- reachable on foot; HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu -- on the same side of town."},{"question":"Who is Zambala House best for?","answer":"It suits couples, quiet-seeking travellers, mid-length stays. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Zambala House?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Quiet end of Himachal Tourism Road","Consistently high guest ratings for cleanliness and staff","Restaurant and breakfast on site","Mountain views and laundry service"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Quiet-seeking travellers","Mid-length stays"]'::jsonb, '["Namgyal Monastery and the markets -- reachable on foot","HPTDC Hotel Bhagsu -- on the same side of town"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://in.via.com/hotels/zambala-house-950437 , https://wanderlog.com/place/details/4445547 , https://www.mcleodganjhotels.net/zambala-house.en.html. No verified own photos yet -- page shows an area photo.', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-akash-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Akash', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Akash is one of the bigger hotels on Jogiwara Road, with 56 rooms spread over several floors. Room types include Superior, Deluxe, Comfort and a Family Studio Suite, all with queen beds, and the decor leans towards Tibetan hangings and wood panelling. Guests rate it around 8 out of 10 on booking sites, and it is priced at the budget end for a hotel of its size.

There is free parking, free WiFi in public areas, a rooftop restaurant with an artificial-grass terrace and views over the rooftops and hills, a massage room and a 24-hour front desk. It sits about a ten to fifteen minute walk from the Dalai Lama Temple complex and Tushita, so you will be on foot a fair amount, with some uphill. It suits families, groups and budget-minded couples who want a proper hotel rather than a guesthouse.', 'A large, good-value Jogiwara Road hotel with Tibetan-style rooms, a rooftop garden restaurant and free parking.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Free parking","Restaurant","Rooftop terrace","Massage room","24-hour front desk","Tour and ticket booking","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585x12000ncymfw694AF_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Hotel Akash building with red railings on Jogiwara Road","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0220912000kxdo3v73CB3_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Guest room with Tibetan hangings at Hotel Akash","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0224o12000kxdnteoFC6F_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Reception with a portrait of the Dalai Lama at Hotel Akash","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222c12000kxdob3o9316_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Rooftop restaurant garden terrace at Hotel Akash","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0580212000ncynaqq70D3_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Rooftop terrace seating with views at Hotel Akash","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0580d12000ncynbzv98FC_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Hotel Akash lit up in the evening","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripc