('hotel-mount-view-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Mount View', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Mount View is on Jogiwara Road near the McLeod Ganj post office and is attached to a small shopping complex. It offers Deluxe, Superior, Premium and Royal rooms plus a Family Suite with a king bed, and most are described as mountain-view rooms that sleep up to three. Guests rate it highly, around 8.8 out of 10 on some booking sites, and mention the views from the balconies, the staff and the quiet.

The main caution is access: there is no lift and the way up from the road involves a flight of steep steps, so it is less suitable for anyone with mobility problems or heavy luggage. Breakfast is served on request for a fee, and the hotel has room service, laundry and a 24-hour front desk. It is a comfortable mid-range base for couples and families that is a few minutes from the centre.', 'A well-regarded three-star hotel next to the post office on Jogiwara Road with mountain-view rooms and family suites.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, near the Post Office, McLeod Ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, near the Post Office, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Room service","Laundry service","24-hour front desk","Breakfast available","Airport transfer","Balcony","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Superior Room","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Premium Room","description":"","bed_type":"Queen","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Family Suite","description":"","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Royal Room","description":"","bed_type":"Queen","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel Mount View located?","answer":"Hotel Mount View is in Jogiwara Road, near the Post Office, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: McLeod Ganj Post Office -- on the same stretch of Jogiwara Road; Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- near, per booking listings."},{"question":"Who is Hotel Mount View best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families, mountain-view seekers. See other st