('hotel-pawan-regency-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Pawan Regency', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Pawan Regency opened in 2023 and has about 15 rooms, all with king beds, in Premium, Deluxe and Superior categories. Photos show bright, modern rooms with wood-framed windows, a small lobby and a restaurant with a big picture window and a roof terrace facing the hills. Guests score it a little above 8 out of 10 on booking sites.

It is on Jogiwara Road, roughly a 15-minute walk from the Dalai Lama Temple and the Namgyal and Tsechokling monasteries, with a spa, an Ayurvedic centre and a few Tibetan-run shops very close by. Free parking, a restaurant, room service and WiFi are listed. Rooms are non-smoking. It is a good choice for couples and families who want a fresh, new hotel and are comfortable with the uphill walk back from town. Note it is a different business from the older Pawan Guest House on the same road.', 'A small, recently opened Jogiwara Road hotel with king-bed rooms and a glass-fronted restaurant looking over the town and hills.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Room service","Free parking","Roof terrace","Balcony","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222912000oc7lhkoA2FB_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"King-bed room with wood-framed windows at Hotel Pawan Regency","category":"room","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0584912000stpmee53E73_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Reception with Pawan Regency sign at Hotel Pawan Regency","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222x12000o990fix5D25_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Restaurant with picture window over the hills at Hotel Pawan Regency","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0225q12000l0sso4nC294_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Roof terrace seating with town and mountain views at Hotel Pawan Regency","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0224b12000l0ssi64353D_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Guest room with balcony door and TV at Hotel Pawan Regency","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226012000o990cb4AD5C_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Dining area beside the ter