('hotel-lavish-inn-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Lavish Inn', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Lavish Inn is a compact hotel of about 17 rooms on Jogiwara Road, close to the post office and within a couple of minutes of the McLeod Square temple and the Tibet local market. Rooms are sold as Executive, Deluxe and Super Deluxe, and the photos show tidy, bright rooms with a sofa and a window or small balcony.

What sets it apart from many budget stays is that it has a lift and an in-house restaurant, cafe and bar (Black Magic Restaurant and Bar), with free parking and 24-hour front desk. Smoking is not allowed inside the hotel. It works well for groups of friends and couples who want a central base with evening food and drinks on site and do not need a view-focused room.', 'A 17-room hotel close to the main square on Jogiwara Road, with a restaurant, bar and lift.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, near the Post Office, McLeod Ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, near the Post Office, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["Restaurant","Cafe","Bar","Room service","Free parking","Lift","Laundry service","24-hour front desk","Luggage storage"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222412000jjhfl7wFD25_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Hotel Lavish Inn illuminated signboard","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0584512000tcabmby5054_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Double room with sofa and window at Hotel Lavish Inn","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0224112000j7m7l988954_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Room with green accent bedding and balcony window at Hotel Lavish Inn","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0225o12000j7m7r5k539F_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Restaurant seating at Hotel Lavish Inn","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0221912000j7m7qfg3699_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Black Magic Club bar counter at Hotel Lavish Inn","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0583g12000svs2ies809A_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Executive room with padded headboard at Hotel Lavish Inn","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Executive Room","description":"","bed_type":""