('la-riqueza-koala-inn-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'La Riqueza Koala Inn', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'La Riqueza Koala Inn opened in 2024 on Jogiwara Road, in a modern multi-storey building among deodar trees. Listings describe mountain-view rooms with balconies, and the room types include Deluxe and Superior rooms with balconies, a Family Room with a queen and two single beds, and a Quadruple Room that sleeps four. There is a restaurant, a coffee shop, a lobby bar and a roof terrace that catches the sunset over the hills.

Free parking, car-charging facilities, laundry and a 24-hour front desk make it practical for road-trippers. It is close to the Ayurvedic centre, a spa and several Tibetan craft shops on the road, and about 15 minutes on foot from the Dalai Lama Temple. Booking sites disagree on the exact room count and check-in time, so confirm both when you book. It is a good fit for families and groups.', 'A new, cedar-shaded hotel on Jogiwara Road with balcony rooms, a rooftop sun deck and EV charging.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Cafe","Bar","Free parking","EV charging","Laundry service","Luggage storage","24-hour front desk","Balcony","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585312000tz20bl98CB5_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"La Riqueza Koala Inn building among trees at dusk","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik2w12000nj8tm6750F3_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"La Riqueza Koala Inn building surrounded by deodar trees","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0220812000o1p4jo9C943_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Room with large TV and balcony doors at La Riqueza Koala Inn","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226912000o1p4lrw60E1_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Balcony room looking over the forested valley at La Riqueza Koala Inn","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik2s12000tvz9sb084AD_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Rooftop terrace seating at sunset at La Riqueza Koala Inn","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226r12000lnal192258C_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Timber-clad corridor at La Riqueza Koala Inn","category":"other","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Delux