('the-bougainvillea-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'The Bougainvillea', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'The Bougainvillea is a bed-and-breakfast style guesthouse on Jogiwara Road, opposite Youngling School. It opened in 2018 and was renovated in 2023, and has 16 rooms: Superior rooms with balconies, a Deluxe room with mountain views, a Superior Corner room and beds in a four-bed mixed dorm. Photos show warm wood-panelled rooms and a sunny covered terrace lounge with sofas and valley views.

Guests rate it highly on MakeMyTrip for cleanliness and facilities. The big practical point is the access: reviewers say you climb roughly 70 to 80 steep steps to reach it, which is hard for older travellers, families with young children or anyone with heavy bags. A spa, an Ayurvedic centre and Tibetan craft shops are right nearby. It suits backpackers, couples and small groups who like a social, informal stay.', 'A bright yellow Jogiwara Road guesthouse of 16 rooms with balcony rooms, dorm beds and a lounge terrace.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, opposite Youngling School, McLeod Ganj', 'Jogiwara Road, opposite Youngling School, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Room service","Breakfast available","Taxi booking","Tour desk","Smoking area","Balcony","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0224n12000eq7371m8EAD_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"The Bougainvillea yellow building with balconies on Jogiwara Road","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik5512000t5wygvv5C40_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Wood-panelled room with balcony windows at The Bougainvillea","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0586o12000jeucdz0792F_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Covered terrace lounge with sofas and valley views at The Bougainvillea","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585112000nrtr3nh4007_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Four-bed dormitory with bunks at The Bougainvillea","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik5j12000t4mhyfc545A_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Terrace lounge seating at The Bougainvillea","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0220812000en7589m1693_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"The Bougainvillea building seen from below in evening light","category":"exterior