packers","Couples","Small groups"]'::jsonb, '["Prana Spa -- under 100 m","Tibet local market -- about 250 m","Start of the Triund trek path -- short walk","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 15 min walk"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://in.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-114121466/the-bougainvillea-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://in.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-114121466/the-bougainvillea-mcleodganj/ , https://www.makemytrip.com/hotels/review-of-the_bougainvillea_mcleodganj-details-dharamshala.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('zostel-mcleodganj-jogiwara-road', 'Zostel McLeodganj', 'hostel', 'published', 'directory', 'This Zostel is housed in the Pink House on Jogiwara Road, a short walk from the centre of McLeod Ganj and wrapped in deodar trees. It offers beds in six-bed female and mixed dorms, plus private rooms: Superior rooms with a balcony and queen bed, and Deluxe Triple rooms with a balcony. The common areas are painted in bright Tibetan-inspired colours, with a lounge, a cafe and restaurant, a games area, and a terrace with a fire pit and mountain views.

It is a sociable place for solo travellers, and karaoke and a games area are listed among the facilities. Guests give it around 7.7 to 7.8 out of 10 on Trip.com and Hostelworld, with location rated highest. Note that Trip.com lists the main guest as needing to be 18 or over. Zostel also runs a property in Dharamkot, which is listed separately here.', 'A colourful Zostel hostel in the Pink House on Jogiwara Road, with dorms, private rooms, a cafe and a mountain-view terrace.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Pink House, Jogiwara Road, opposite Yongling School, McLeod Ganj', 'Pink House, Jogiwara Road, opposite Yongling School, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Cafe","Restaurant","Lockers","Luggage storage","Gaming area","Smoking area","Roof terrace","Mountain views","Karaoke"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik5s12000s07lzse50B9_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Zostel McLeodganj painted building among deodar trees","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0580812000rywiaciB664_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Private room with balcony and bed at Zostel McLeodganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0224v12000sqbqm3eEBC7_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Reception desk with Zostel branding at Zostel McLeodganj","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0586p12000ry68hurD0BA_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Common lounge with red brick wall and mandala art at Zostel McLeodganj","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585u12000s10gy350303_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Mural-painted terrace with mountain views at Zostel McLeodganj","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0587312000swki55aF0AA_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Superior room at Zostel McLeodganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order