nts","Lockers and luggage storage"]'::jsonb, '["Solo travellers","Backpackers","Digital nomads"]'::jsonb, '["Prana Spa -- about 50 m","Gonpo''s Tibetan History Library -- about 70 m","Tibet local market -- about 250 m","McLeod Square Temple -- about 400 m"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://us.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-99542724/zostel-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://us.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-99542724/zostel-mcleodganj/ , https://www.hostelworld.com/fr/auberges-de-jeunesse/p/315332/zostel-mcleodganj/', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-the-nest-jogiwara-road-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel The Nest', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'The Nest sits at the far end of Jogiwara Road on Shivam Marg, so it is quieter than the hotels near the main square. The hostel and hotel listings describe 25 rooms in categories such as Cozy (AC), Superior Studio, Deluxe Double and Queen rooms, with views of the Dhauladhar range from many of them. Reviewers praise the staff, cleanliness and views.

There is a rooftop multi-cuisine restaurant, in-room dining, a conference room, a travel desk and a doctor on call, and the hotel runs an evening shuttle to a nearby mall. The main market is around 900 metres away by road, or about 200 steps if you take the stairs, roughly a 15-minute walk, and it is a short car ride along a narrow road to reach the hotel itself. It suits couples, families and anyone who prefers quiet and a view to being in the thick of town.', 'A 25-room hotel at the quiet end of Jogiwara Road with views of the Dhauladhar, a rooftop restaurant and an evening shuttle to the mall.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Shivam Marg, end of Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Shivam Marg, end of Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Free parking","Restaurant","Room service","Conference room","Travel desk","Luggage storage","24-hour reception","Backup power","Mountain views","Rooftop restaurant","Evening shuttle to the mall"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/310983/jqcalnhqjn2wy7r12mrh","alt":"Hotel The Nest building with signboard","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/310983/nbxfwj6swsknlxypdqko","alt":"Double room with blue accents at Hotel The Nest","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/310983/i5jaiybo6sxi8wzxir3l","alt":"Lobby lounge and reception at Hotel The Nest","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/310983/ienhn26j1k7lkayrmoww","alt":"Balcony with cane chairs and forest views at Hotel The Nest","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/310983/tgwmcyb38hzb0jnasg6k","alt":"Lounge seating area at Hotel The Nest","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/310983/o7iwvf5qtayjcpvghrxv","alt":"Reception desk at Hotel The Nest","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Hotel The Nest located?","answer":"Hotel The Nest is in Shivam Marg, end of Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: McLeod Ganj main square -- about 600 m; Main market -- about 15 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Hotel The Nest?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Hotel The Nest best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families, quiet-seeking travellers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Hotel The Nest?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Quiet end of Jogiwara Road with Dhauladhar views","Rooftop multi-cuisine restaurant","Evening shuttle to the mall","Free parking and 24-hour reception"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Families","Quiet-seeking travellers"]'::jsonb, '["McLeod Ganj main square -- about 600 m","Main market -- about 15 min walk","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- described as easily accessible"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.hostelworld.com/hotels/p/310983/hotel-the-nest/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.hostelworld.com/hotels/p/310983/hotel-the-nest/ , https://vi.hotels.com/ho1288265696/hotel-the-nest-dharamshala-an-o , https://www.expedia.com/cn/Dharamshala-Hotels-Hotel-The-Nest.h40227053.Hotel-Information', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hillora-mcleodganj-shivam-marg', 'HillOra McLeodganj', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'HillOra is a small hotel of about nine rooms on Shivam Marg, off Jogiwara Road. Rooms are Superior Double or Twin with a balcony, and the photos show simple, bright rooms and views of the forested hillside. Breakfast is included according to the property''s own Hostelworld listing, and there is a 24-hour reception, free parking and WiFi.

The listing places it close to the Dalai Lama Temple, Bhagsu Waterfall and the Triund trek, though the temple is a bit of a walk and some of it is uphill. A shuttle and airport transfers are listed. With so few rooms it feels more like a guesthouse than a hotel, and it appeals to couples and small families who want quiet and a view. Taxes are charged on top of the room rate and check-out times differ between listings, so confirm these when booking.', 'A small nine-room boutique hotel on Shivam Marg with balcony rooms facing the mountains and breakfast included.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Shivam Marg, Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Shivam Marg, Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Free parking","Breakfast included","Luggage storage","24-hour reception","Airport transfer","Shuttle","Balcony","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/330709/gq7080wrpbfll2mosctb","alt":"Bed and balcony window with hill views at HillOra McLeodganj","category":"room","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/330709/warpjjllvb3o8x7ks3fi","alt":"Room with balcony door and view of McLeod Ganj at HillOra McLeodganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/330709/gwxb4blqpv6r23wwxfok","alt":"Room window looking over the valley at HillOra McLeodganj","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/330709/pkmvyulzwddwqekaskgh","alt":"Room with wall-mounted TV at HillOra McLeodganj","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://a.hwstatic.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200/v1/propertyimages/3/330709/dhcixdc4qvj3gedaryev","alt":"Bathroom at HillOra McLeodganj","category":"bathroom","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Superior Double or Twin Room with Balcony","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is HillOra McLeodganj located?","answer":"HillOra McLeodganj is in Shivam Marg, Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk; Bhagsunag Waterfall -- short drive."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at HillOra McLeodganj?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is HillOra McLeodganj best for?","answer":"It suits couples, small families, quiet stays. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for HillOra McLeodganj?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mid-range', '["Only nine rooms, balconies facing the hills","Breakfast included in rates","Free parking and WiFi","Quiet Shivam Marg location"]'::jsonb, '["Couples","Small families","Quiet stays"]'::jsonb, '["Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 10 min walk","Bhagsunag Waterfall -- short drive","Triund trek trailhead -- short drive","McLeod Ganj centre -- about 1.9 km"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://www.hostelworld.com/hotels/p/330709/hillora-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://www.hostelworld.com/hotels/p/330709/hillora-mcleodganj/ , https://www.expedia.com/es/Dharamshala-Hoteles-Hillora.h112265964.Informacion-Hotel , https://ae.hotels.com/es/ho3593510848/hillora', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('albela-house-hotel-shivam-marg-mcleod-ganj', 'Albela House Hotel', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Albela House opened in 2022 and has 20 rooms on Shivam Marg, off Jogiwara Road. It is a multi-storey building with balconies that look out on pine and deodar forest, and the photos show simple rooms with balcony tables, plus a couple of high-up valley views. The hotel has an on-site cafe, laundry, luggage storage and a tour and taxi desk, and listings say pets are allowed for an extra charge.

Reviewers praise the mountain views and friendly staff, but it is built on a slope with many stairs, so it is best suited to people comfortable with climbing, and one reviewer found the rooms small and the food choices limited. Parking and check-in times differ between sites, so check by phone before you come. It is a good-value stay for travellers with a dog or those who want a quiet outlook over the trees.', 'A 20-room budget hotel on Shivam Marg with balconies over the forest and a pet-friendly policy.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Shivam Marg, off Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'Shivam Marg, off Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Cafe","Laundry service","Luggage storage","Tour desk","Taxi booking","Balcony","Pet friendly","Tour and taxi desk"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222t12000clzk528A1EA_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Albela House Hotel building among trees","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226y12000clzk177122B_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Balcony with table and chairs over the forest at Albela House Hotel","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0221f12000clzjnr42F61_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Albela House Hotel lit up at night","category":"exterior","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0223712000clzjyj473DC_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Balcony seating with valley views at Albela House Hotel","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0223f12000e09dgkyE6D6_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Cloud over forested hillside seen from Albela House Hotel","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Albela House Hotel located?","answer":"Albela House Hotel is in Shivam Marg, off Jogiwara Road, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Gonpo''s Tibetan History Library -- short walk; Buddhist temple -- short walk."},{"question":"Who is Albela House Hotel best for?","answer":"It suits travellers with pets, budget travellers, nature lovers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Albela House Hotel?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Pets (dogs and cats) are listed as allowed for an extra charge.', 'Smoking only in assigned areas.', NULL, 'budget', '["Pets allowed for an extra charge","Balconies over forested hillside","On-site cafe and laundry","Quiet Shivam Marg setting"]'::jsonb, '["Travellers with pets","Budget travellers","Nature lovers"]'::jsonb, '["Gonpo''s Tibetan History Library -- short walk","Buddhist temple -- short walk","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- about 15 min walk"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://us.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-97340873/albela-house-hotel-mcleodganj/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://us.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-97340873/albela-house-hotel-mcleodganj/ , https://wanderlog.com/place/details/10091203/albela-house-hotel-best-hotel-in-mcleodganj-dharamshala--budget-hotel-in-mcleodganj , https://www.mcleodganjhotels.net/albela-house-mcleodganj.en.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-asian-plaza-main-square-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Asian Plaza', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Hotel Asian Plaza is on the Main Square, which makes it about as central as you can get in McLeod Ganj. It opened in 2003, was renovated in 2021 and has 15 rooms: Deluxe rooms and Superior Doubles with queen beds and a Luxury Suite with a king bed, all described as having mountain views. The hotel has a restaurant, a lobby bar, a massage room and a small seasonal outdoor swimming pool, and it offers free parking, luggage storage and 24-hour front desk.

The McLeod Square temple, the Tibet local market and Stories of Tibetans are all within a few minutes on foot, and the Dalai Lama Temple is about a 15-minute walk. Because it is on the square, expect more activity outside than in a quieter lane. It suits first-time visitors, families and groups who want everything on their doorstep. Pets are not allowed.', 'A long-standing 15-room hotel right on the Main Square, with a restaurant, bar, massage room and a seasonal outdoor pool.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Main Square, McLeod Ganj', 'Main Square, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Bar","Massage room","Swimming pool","Free parking","Luggage storage","Laundry service","24-hour front desk","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226x12000l0gzmyb1700_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Hotel Asian Plaza balconies facing the Main Square","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222j12000ln25yck9024_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Spacious suite with king bed and sitting area at Hotel Asian Plaza","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226e12000l0gzl25D5D9_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Reception and lobby at Hotel Asian Plaza","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik5q12000o5nci2sE3E1_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Restaurant seating at Hotel Asian Plaza","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0224r12000l0gzr51224F_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Terrace with seating and mountain views at Hotel Asian Plaza","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0222x12000l0gzmd3D609_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Lobby staircase at Hotel Asian Plaza","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0223i12000l0gzx6eE45F_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","a