('shree-guest-house-main-square-mcleod-ganj', 'Shree Guest House', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'Shree Guest House is a small guesthouse of nine rooms, a couple of minutes on foot from the Main Square, set among trees. Rooms are Deluxe, Standard and Budget, all with a double bed and a private bathroom, with a TV in some. It has a cafe where guests are offered coffee each day, free parking, WiFi in public areas and a 24-hour front desk.

Guests describe it as good value and pleasantly quiet. The honest drawback is the approach: the lane to the guesthouse is steep and one reviewer found the climb of around 200 metres hard going, so ask about vehicle access if you have limited mobility or a lot of luggage. The Himalayan wellness spa, a tea shop and the Namgyalma Stupa with its prayer wheels are all within a few minutes. It suits budget travellers, couples and solo visitors.', 'A nine-room guesthouse a couple of minutes above the Main Square, with a cafe, free parking and woodland around it.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Just above the Main Square, McLeod Ganj', 'Just above the Main Square, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Cafe","Free parking","Laundry service","Luggage storage","Room service","24-hour front desk"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0584g12000ncykizlBDBF_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Shree Guest House green building and courtyard","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik2h12000t7jkwghD861_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Double room with Tibetan rug at Shree Guest House","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0582n12000hsyzn4nA8EC_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Room with window onto the trees at Shree Guest House","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik4h12000t7jrhf2A2AC_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Single bed room with wooden table at Shree Guest House","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0586k12000twvso0g2492_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Balcony among tall trees at Shree Guest House","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0221i12000ap7jyd7F874_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Landing with desk and Tibetan thangka at Shree Guest House","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":5},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0586d12000mcy3nebCD35_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Corridor at Shree Guest House","category":"other","is_primary":false,"sort_order":6}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Standard Room","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Budget Room","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Shree Guest House located?","answer":"Shree Guest House is in Just above the Main Square, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: McLeod Ganj Main Square -- about 2 min walk; Namgyalma Stupa and prayer wheels -- about 180 m."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Shree Guest House?","answer":"Check-in is from 13:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Shree Guest House best for?","answer":"It suits budget travellers, solo travellers, couples. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Shree Guest House?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '13:00', '11:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'budget', '["Two minutes on foot from the Main Square","Quiet, wooded surroundings","Cafe and free parking","Good-value Budget, Standard and Deluxe rooms"]'::jsonb, '["Budget travellers","Solo travellers","Couples"]'::jsonb, '["McLeod Ganj Main Square -- about 2 min walk","Namgyalma Stupa and prayer wheels -- about 180 m","McLeod Square Temple -- about 200 m","Tibet local market -- short walk"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://uk.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-