('mcleodganj-bed-and-breakfast-dharamkot-road', 'Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast', 'guesthouse', 'published', 'directory', 'Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast is a small guesthouse on Dharamkot Road, opposite the Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts. It opened in 2009, was renovated in 2019 and has seven rooms: Deluxe Double, Standard, Master and Cottage Double rooms. It has a garden, a library, a shared kitchen, a cafe, free parking and a laundry service, and smoking is limited to designated areas.

The setting is calm and green and a short walk from the Tushita Meditation Centre and trekking routes towards Triund and Bhagsunag. Guests like the location near the main walking street, though one notes that it takes a while to go down to the temple area and up to Dharamkot. It suits couples, longer-stay travellers and anyone wanting a homely, low-key base that is not on the main square.', 'A small garden guesthouse across from TIPA with seven rooms, a library, shared kitchen and a cafe.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Dharamkot Road, opposite TIPA (Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts), McLeod Ganj', 'Dharamkot Road, opposite TIPA (Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts), McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Cafe","Library","Garden","Shared kitchen","Free parking","Laundry service","Luggage storage"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0584z12000t1fp6qu5D6C_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast building among deodar trees","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585t12000svgtrxkDE22_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Room with balcony windows onto the pines at Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0581e12000u2fkjdjF19C_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Double room with brick wall and bed at Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0227112000tn1tf4lCF3A_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Cottage-style room with sleeping loft at Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0226r12000bngx4n987F7_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Wooden dining terrace with tree views at Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4}]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Deluxe Double Room","description":"","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Standard Room","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Cottage Double Room","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Master Room","description":"","bed_type":"Double","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast located?","answer":"Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast is in Dharamkot Road, opposite TIPA (Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts), McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts (TIPA) -- opposite; Tushita Meditation Centre -- about 640 m."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast?","answer":"Check-in is from 12:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast best for?","answer":"It suits longer stays, couples, trekkers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Mcleodganj Bed and Breakfast?","answer":"Send an enquiry or WhatsApp us with your dates and number of guests. We check availability and rates for you, or suggest a similar stay in McLeod Ganj."}]'::jsonb, '12:00', '11:00', NULL, 'Smoking only in designated areas.', NULL, 'budget', '["Seven rooms with a garden and library","Shared kitchen for longer stays","Directly opposite TIPA on Dharamkot Road","Close to Tushita and the Triund trail"]'::jsonb, '["Longer stays","Couples","Trekkers"]'::jsonb, '["Tibetan Institute of Performing Arts (TIPA) -- opposite","Tushita Meditation Centre -- about 640 m","Vulture Explorers (trek operator) -- about 370 m","Triund trek -- starts a short drive away"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://in.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-61945868/mcleodganj-homestay/', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://in.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-61945868/mcleodganj-homestay/ , https://www.mcleodganjhotels.net/bnb-mcleodganj.en.html , https://www.cleartrip.ae/hotels/info/mcleodganj-homestay-1355812', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('hotel-woodville-inn-mcleod-ganj', 'Hotel Woodville Inn', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Woodville Inn is one of the larger hotels in the temple end of McLeod Ganj, with 58 air-conditioned rooms. Room types listed include Basic, Classic, Executive and Deluxe, and the photos show a polished lobby with carved wood panelling, a long restaurant, a lounge and balconies with big hill views. Guests rate it around 8 out of 10 and praise the views and staff, though one reviewer found the linen not as fresh as they hoped.

Facilities include free parking, a bar, a restaurant, WiFi, a lift and a 24-hour front desk. Breakfast is available for a fee, and the property has CCTV and security staff. Booking sites place it a few minutes from the Dalai Lama Temple and Namgyal Monastery and disagree on the exact road, so check the pin location before arriving. Some rooms permit smoking while others do not. It suits families and groups.', 'A big 58-room hotel with a wood-panelled lobby, restaurant, bar and terrace views over the hills, a few minutes from the temple.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Near the Dalai Lama Temple, McLeod Ganj', 'Near the Dalai Lama Temple, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Restaurant","Bar","Free parking","Lift","Room service","Laundry service","24-hour front desk","Terrace","Mountain views","CCTV"]'::jsonb, '[{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0584u12000su8zrsr2543_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Hotel Woodville Inn building lit up at night","category":"exterior","is_primary":true,"sort_order":0},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/1ik6r12000nq8qiql1682_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Wood-panelled reception desk at Hotel Woodville Inn","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":1},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0580112000szg0iafF45F_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Twin guest room with balcony view at Hotel Woodville Inn","category":"room","is_primary":false,"sort_order":2},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0581u12000t0f8x4s2884_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Lounge seating area at Hotel Woodville Inn","category":"lobby","is_primary":false,"sort_order":3},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0585l12000tr9i1lyF2A3_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Restaurant dining hall at Hotel Woodville Inn","category":"restaurant","is_primary":false,"sort_order":4},{"url":"https://ak-d.tripcdn.com/images/0586m12000jc6zte9F3D4_R_960_660_R5_D.jpg","alt":"Terrace with green turf and hill views at Hotel Woodville Inn","category":"view","is_primary":false,"sort_order