 Monastery -- about 4 min walk","Start of the kora circuit -- about 200 m","Tsechokling Gompa -- about 250 m","Tsuglagkhang (Dalai Lama Temple) -- a few minutes on foot"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://ph.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-104593851/hotel-woodville-inn-mcleodganj', 'Directory listing added Oct 2026. Verified operating via: https://ph.trip.com/hotels/kangra-hotel-detail-104593851/hotel-woodville-inn-mcleodganj , https://in.hotels.com/ho3503425088/ , https://www.mcleodganjhotels.net/woodville-hotel-in-mcleodganj.en.html', 0, 0, 0, NOW(), (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role = 'admin' ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1)),
('alivaa-hotel-forsyth-ganj-mcleod-ganj', 'Alivaa Hotel McLeodganj', 'hotel', 'published', 'directory', 'Alivaa Hotel is in Forsyth Ganj, the quieter wooded part of McLeod Ganj near St. John in the Wilderness and the Dalai Lama''s residence. It has 18 rooms, including Premium rooms and Deluxe rooms with a king bed and valley view, each sleeping up to three. The property has an outdoor swimming pool, a restaurant, a bar, room service and free parking, and it markets the Dhauladhar views as the main draw.

St. John in the Wilderness and the Dalai Lama''s residence are roughly ten minutes on foot, and Dal Lake is a short drive. Check-in is from 2 pm and check-out is at noon. Pets are not allowed. Listings place it a step above most mid-range hotels in town on price, so it suits couples and families looking for a quieter, more comfortable stay away from the crowds of the Main Square. Do not confuse it with the separate Alivaa Boutique on Tipa Road.', 'A small 18-room hotel in Forsyth Ganj with an outdoor pool, valley-view king rooms and Dhauladhar views.', 'mcleod-ganj', 'Forsyth Ganj, McLeod Ganj', 'Forsyth Ganj, McLeod Ganj', 'McLeod Ganj', 'Himachal Pradesh', '["WiFi","Swimming pool","Restaurant","Bar","Room service","Free parking","24-hour front desk","Balcony","Mountain views"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name":"Premium Room","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Deluxe Room with Valley View","description":"","bed_type":"","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true},{"name":"Deluxe King Room with Balcony","description":"","bed_type":"King","max_occupancy":null,"base_price":0,"rate_plans":[],"images":[],"amenities":[],"is_active":true}]'::jsonb, '[{"question":"Where is Alivaa Hotel McLeodganj located?","answer":"Alivaa Hotel McLeodganj is in Forsyth Ganj, McLeod Ganj. Nearby: Dalai Lama''s residence -- about 11 min walk; St. John in the Wilderness -- about 7 min walk."},{"question":"What are the check-in and check-out times at Alivaa Hotel McLeodganj?","answer":"Check-in is from 14:00 and check-out is by 12:00. Confirm early check-in or late check-out when you enquire."},{"question":"Who is Alivaa Hotel McLeodganj best for?","answer":"It suits couples, families, quiet-seeking travellers. See other stays in McLeod Ganj if you want a different style or budget."},{"question":"How do I check rates for Alivaa Hotel McLeodga